# AI Code Review Agent: Cloud Run Production Readiness Walkthrough

This walkthrough outlines all fixes, architectural upgrades, security hardening, and deployment tooling implemented to make the **AI Code Review Agent** 100% ready for deployment to **Google Cloud Run**.

---

## Summary of Accomplishments

| Area | Prototype State | Production State for Cloud Run |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Containerization** | Broken `DockerFile` (no python/pip, wrong command `python3 app.py`, no port binding). | Standard [Dockerfile](file:///c:/AI%20Code%20Review%20Agent/Dockerfile) using `python:3.11-slim`, dynamic `$PORT` binding (`uvicorn app.main:app`), optimized caching. |
| **Build Artifacts** | Missing `.dockerignore`; `requirements.txt` was corrupted in UTF-16LE with BOM. | Added [.dockerignore](file:///c:/AI%20Code%20Review%20Agent/.dockerignore); converted [requirements.txt](file:///c:/AI%20Code%20Review%20Agent/requirements.txt) to clean UTF-8 and added `google-cloud-firestore`. |
| **State Persistence** | Local JSON file ([approvals_db.json](file:///c:/AI%20Code%20Review%20Agent/approvals_db.json)); wiped on serverless scale-down/restart, causing 404s across multiple instances. | Pluggable storage in [approval_service.py](file:///c:/AI%20Code%20Review%20Agent/app/services/approval_service.py) supporting **Google Cloud Firestore** for Cloud Run with local JSON fallback for dev/tests. |
| **Webhook Security** | Unauthenticated `/webhook` endpoint vulnerable to arbitrary spam and quota exhaustion. | Added GitHub HMAC-SHA256 signature verification (`X-Hub-Signature-256`) in [webhook.py](file:///c:/AI%20Code%20Review%20Agent/app/api/webhook.py) with development bypass if unset. |
| **Monitoring & Probes**| No dedicated health check. | Added `/health` probe endpoint to [main.py](file:///c:/AI%20Code%20Review%20Agent/app/main.py) for Cloud Run startup/liveness checks. |
| **Deployment Tooling** | None. | Added [deploy_cloud_run.sh](file:///c:/AI%20Code%20Review%20Agent/deploy_cloud_run.sh) and [deploy_cloud_run.ps1](file:///c:/AI%20Code%20Review%20Agent/deploy_cloud_run.ps1) with recommended flags. |

