## Key Changes by Component

### 1. Production Containerization
- **[Dockerfile](file:///c:/AI%20Code%20Review%20Agent/Dockerfile)**:
  - Base: `python:3.11-slim`
  - Installs runtime dependencies with `--no-cache-dir`.
  - Exposes port 8080 and binds dynamically to Cloud Run's `${PORT:-8080}`:
    ```dockerfile
    CMD ["sh", "-c", "exec uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port ${PORT:-8080}"]
    ```
- **[.dockerignore](file:///c:/AI%20Code%20Review%20Agent/.dockerignore)**:
  - Excludes `.env`, `venv/`, `.git/`, `approvals_db.json`, `tests/`, and cache directories to protect secrets and ensure slim image sizes.
- **[requirements.txt](file:///c:/AI%20Code%20Review%20Agent/requirements.txt)**:
  - Re-encoded to UTF-8 without BOM so Linux container builds parse dependencies properly. Added `google-cloud-firestore>=2.14.0`.

### 2. Pluggable State Persistence
- **[approval_service.py](file:///c:/AI%20Code%20Review%20Agent/app/services/approval_service.py)**:
  - Implemented `BaseApprovalStore`, `JsonFileApprovalStore`, and `FirestoreApprovalStore`.
  - Automatically selects `FirestoreApprovalStore` when `STORAGE_BACKEND=firestore` is set in Cloud Run.
  - Automatically falls back to `JsonFileApprovalStore` for local development and offline unit tests.
  - Maintained complete backwards compatibility for all existing callers.

### 3. Webhook Security & Verification
- **[webhook.py](file:///c:/AI%20Code%20Review%20Agent/app/api/webhook.py)**:
  - Implemented `verify_github_signature(raw_body, signature_header)`.
  - Computes `sha256` HMAC using `GITHUB_WEBHOOK_SECRET` and compares via constant-time `hmac.compare_digest`.
  - Returns `401 Unauthorized` on invalid or spoofed webhook requests.

### 4. Health Check Endpoint
- **[main.py](file:///c:/AI%20Code%20Review%20Agent/app/main.py)**:
  - Added `@app.get("/health")` returning:
    ```json
    {
      "status": "healthy",
      "service": "ai-code-review-agent"
    }
    ```
  - Removed deprecated `add_numbers` test function.

